<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia rubber market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Malaysia rubber market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malaysian rubber market is closed today for the Good Friday holiday, and reopens on March 31.</p>
<p>On Thursday, prices closed little changed on lack of consumers demand, traders said. April RSS Ones buyer closed half a cent lower at 298.50 cents a kg while April SMR 20 buyer held unchanged at previous level of 285 cents.</p>
</text>
